                                                                                
 Usage: python -m run_intelligence list-health-logs [OPTIONS]                   
                                                                                
 List all health log entries.                                                   
                                                                                
 Shows a formatted list of health log entries with dates and key metrics.       
 Example:     run-intelligence list-health-logs     run-intelligence            
 list-health-logs --limit 100                                                   
 Exit codes:     0: Success     1: Database error                               
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --limit        INTEGER  Maximum number of entries to show [default: 50]      │
│ --help                  Show this message and exit.                          │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

